#: laser_essentials/widgets/calibration_test_dialogs.py
msgid "Focus the laser as usual first. The job moves the head to the first offset, engraves one line per offset and returns the head to the starting height. A positive offset means more distance between the head and the material."
msgstr "先像平常一样对焦激光。作业会将激光头移到起始偏移，每个偏移雕刻一条线，然后将激光头移回起始高度。正偏移表示激光头与材料之间的距离更大。"

#: laser_essentials/widgets/calibration_test_dialogs.py
msgid "Focus the laser as usual first. The labels are engraved at that height. Before each line the job pauses: set the head to the first offset, then move it by one step at every following pause, and press Resume. A positive offset means more distance between the head and the material."
msgstr "先像平常一样对焦激光。标签在该高度雕刻。每条线之前作业都会暂停：先把激光头调到起始偏移，之后每次暂停时移动一个步进，然后按“继续”。正偏移表示激光头与材料之间的距离更大。"

